These two ttf files are subsets of Noto Sans CJK SC (Noto Sans SC), used only to render AIHOT's OG
share images (a GB2312 + Latin + punctuation subset; see scripts/og/build-og-font.mjs).

Original font: Noto Sans CJK / Noto Sans SC
