         https://scripts.sil.org/OFL  ·  https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk

The OFL allows embedding, subsetting and redistribution, and requires keeping the copyright and license
notice (this file). The subset fonts may not be sold on their own, but may be distributed freely with
software or products. See the links above for the full OFL text.
